1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:02,040
Sebab apa?

2
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:05,040
Sebab memang Islam ni dia dagang.

3
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:08,934
Nabi kata, bada'al Islamu ghariban,

4
00:00:08,934 --> 00:00:11,217
wa saya'udu ghariban.

5
00:00:11,217 --> 00:00:13,260
Fa tuba lil ghuraba.

6
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:16,140
Bermulanya Islam tu dalam keadaan dagang.

7
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:17,660
Dagang ni maksudnya apa?

8
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:18,860
Aneh.

9
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:20,200
Pelik.

10
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:21,400
Eh?

11
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:23,400
Rare.

12
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:24,740
Unique.

13
00:00:24,850 --> 00:00:26,740
Lain daripada lain.

14
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:29,550
Maknanya, orang kebanyakan nak macam

15
00:00:29,550 --> 00:00:31,860
ni, tapi macam ni pula.

16
00:00:31,860 --> 00:00:33,860
Tengoklah hari ni.

17
00:00:33,860 --> 00:00:34,860
Mana ramai?

18
00:00:34,860 --> 00:00:36,860
Orang datang haji, orang tak datang?

19
00:00:36,860 --> 00:00:38,860
Orang tak datang lagi ramai.

20
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:40,860
Jadi pelik ni, semua pelik.

21
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:42,060
Ghariban.

22
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:44,820
Dagang.

23
00:00:44,860 --> 00:00:48,860
Wa saya'udu ghariban kama bada'a.

24
00:00:48,860 --> 00:00:50,860
Maka akan kembali kepada dagang.

25
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:54,860
Akhir zaman, akan jadi macam tu juga.

26
00:00:54,860 --> 00:00:57,063
Orang yang ikut Islam ni jadi

27
00:00:57,063 --> 00:00:58,720
aneh, jadi pelik.

28
00:00:58,860 --> 00:01:00,860
Sikit ni.

29
00:01:00,860 --> 00:01:02,860
Kemudian Nabi kata apa?

30
00:01:02,860 --> 00:01:04,746
Fa tuba lil ghuraba.

31
00:01:04,746 --> 00:01:06,722
Beroleh kebaikanlah.

32
00:01:06,853 --> 00:01:10,200
Beroleh keelokanlah kepada orang

33
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:12,110
yang meletakkan diri dia dalam

34
00:01:12,110 --> 00:01:14,860
keadaan pelik, dalam keadaan dagang.

35
00:01:14,860 --> 00:01:16,850
Yang ni, menyertai Islam

36
00:01:16,850 --> 00:01:19,450
bersama-sama, memegang teguh agama

37
00:01:19,450 --> 00:01:20,860
Allah SWT.

38
00:01:20,860 --> 00:01:24,460
Itu memang resam, adat bagi agama

39
00:01:24,460 --> 00:01:25,860
kita Islam ni.

40
00:01:25,860 --> 00:01:27,860
Biasanya akan jadi pelik.
